      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Norvia Partner API's policies, the Logic Apps they start or fill a queue for, the .NET local functions each calls, and the TMS API operations at the end. Every Flow: take it in, map\nit, call the TMS.",
